                    GETTING AROUND
 
The basic directions (north, south, east, west, northwest, 
northeast, southwest, southeast, up, and down) are used to
move your character from one room to another.  These 
directions are already aliased for you as follows:
 
        'n'  for north           's'  for south
        'e'  for east            'w'  for west
        'nw' for northwest       'sw' for southwest
        'ne' for northeast       'se' for southeast
        'u'  for up              'd'  for down 
